  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills Development Dialogues in the Maghreb region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The regional UNESCO report &quot;Learning Today, Building Tomorrow: Excellence and Equity through Youth Skills&quot;. This report provides a forward-looking and operational overview of TVET systems in the five Maghreb countries, designed as a decision-making and regional dialogue tool. It uses three complementary lenses: (1) skills demand and macroeconomic analysis, (2) links with the education system, and (3) TVET system transformation focused on excellence, results, and data-driven decision-making. The goal is to identify priority levers and concrete actions for policymakers. Dialogue events to be supported in the region
will allow to shape a regional roadmap and follow-up on the Report&apos;s recommendations.</narrative>
  </description>
